========================================================================
端口清单（12）与两侧归属：
port_id                      produced_by    被算法消费?
  warp_path                  core.align     no 
  pcm.mapped.reference       core.surface   YES
  pcm.mapped.practice        core.surface   YES
  pcm.warped.practice        core.surface   no 
  pitch.reference            core.features  YES
  pitch.practice             core.features  YES
  rms.reference              core.features  YES
  rms.practice               core.features  YES
  chroma.lowres.reference    core.features  no 
  chroma.lowres.practice     core.features  no 
  notes.reference            core.features  YES
  notes.practice             core.features  YES

无算法消费（须有 b/c 类理由）: ['warp_path', 'pcm.warped.practice', 'chroma.lowres.reference', 'chroma.lowres.practice']

ALGORITHMS.required_ports 里但不在 PORTS 里的（悬空声明）: (无)

消费者侧每个算法的入口:
  pitch      entry=harmonica_eval.algorithms.pitch.run required=['pitch.reference', 'pitch.practice', 'notes.reference', 'notes.practice']
  timing     entry=harmonica_eval.algorithms.timing.run required=['pcm.mapped.reference', 'pcm.mapped.practice', 'notes.reference', 'notes.practice']
  dynamics   entry=harmonica_eval.algorithms.dynamics.run required=['rms.reference', 'rms.practice', 'notes.reference', 'notes.practice']
